State 0

    0 $accept: • program $end

    IDENTIFIER          shift, and go to state 1
    TYPE                shift, and go to state 2
    STRUCT              shift, and go to state 3
    UNION               shift, and go to state 4
    ENUM                shift, and go to state 5
    LONG                shift, and go to state 6
